ev_c01_assistantm_talk_acce_case_get_after:
	_MACRO_TALKMSG('dialogue_c01', '27-msg_c01_assistantm_05', 'Hey, you! Yes, you with that cool scarf!\rYou should have seen the boy who came running\nby earlier. He ran past me so quickly that I\fcouldn’t even manage a hello.')
